.SH NAME
.PP
auto-web-setup - Install and activate a web server

\" Convention:
\" Underline anything that is typed verbatim - commands, etc.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
.nf 
.na
auto-web-setup webserver [--server-version sv] [--php-version pv]
.ad
.fi

.SH ARGUMENTS
.nf
.na
web-server          Server software (e.g. apache)
--server-version sv Optional server version if not the default
--php-version sv    Optional PHP version if not the default
.ad
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION

The
.B auto-web-setup
command installs the necessary software to run a web server and
performs a minimal configuration to get it up and running.
PHP is enabled automatically.

.SH RETURN VALUES

0 on success, non-zero error codes otherwise.

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
.na
auto-web-setup apache --server-version 24 --php-version 74
.ad
.fi

